  "priorExpiration": "1997-08-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 756.07 Households with an Individual Development Account. Funds from an individual development account used for unqualified purposes, pursuant to 42 USC 604(h), shall be treated as nonrecurring lump sum income in accordance with 7 CFR 273.9(c)(8).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for He-W 700) #5133, eff 5-2-91; ss by #6507, INTERIM, eff 5-1-97, EXPIRES: 8-29-97; ss and moved by #6549, eff 8-1-97 (from He-W 756.08); rpld by #7510, eff 7-1-01\n\nNew. #7603, eff 12-1-01, ss by #9604, eff 12-1-09; ss by #12481, eff 2-21-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w700.html"
